<title>UK: Energy Group Q1 operating profit up 38 pct.</title>
<headline>Energy Group Q1 operating profit up 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31</p>
<p>			(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit	 138		    vs 100</p>
<p> Sales			1,15		   vs 959</p>
<p>NOTE - Energy Group was separated from Hanson Plc through a demerger today after shareholders gave their approval last week.</p>
<p>Breakdown operating profit -</p>
<p> Coal			 25		     vs same</p>
<p> Power			57		     vs 23</p>
<p>Breakdown revenues -</p>
<p> Coal			 325		    vs 329</p>
<p> Power			759		    vs 501</p>
